  "_comment": "Named UI states rendered by `Calendr --snapshot <state> --out <png> --size WxH` (scripts/snapshots.sh). An entry may override 'state' (the app state to render) and 'size'. 'mockup' is the mockupDir scene it is compared with (index.html#<mockup>, '&key=value' adds picks); scripts/render-mockup.swift writes it to <mockupDir>/shots/<mockup>.png after running the optional 'js' step, and scripts/compare-all.sh diffs it against the snapshot.",
